# A document you can use

This is real Darkmown source. Trust this document to enable its local controls.

:state count = 0
:computed doubled = count * 2

Count: { count }.

Double: { doubled }.

:button "Add one" -> count++
:button "Subtract one" -> count--

These values are temporary preview state. Saving the document saves the source, not your current count.
